WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.914
Every morning, a Swiss practice
assistant opens one inbox.

2
00:00:05.482 --> 00:00:11.138
Lab reports, refill requests,
insurer forms, faxes, in four languages.

3
00:00:11.738 --> 00:00:15.040
Almost all of it is protected
by professional secrecy.

4
00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.750
Swiss family doctors spend
9.5 hours a week on administration.

5
00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:22.219
Meet Inbrev.

6
00:00:22.616 --> 00:00:28.947
It runs Apertus, the open Swiss model,
on a small server inside the practice.

7
00:00:29.548 --> 00:00:31.710
One click sorts 30 messages.

8
00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:35.155
Inbrev never judges clinical content.

9
00:00:35.754 --> 00:00:41.455
Any message that may need a clinician
leaves automation and goes to a person –

10
00:00:41.455 --> 00:00:43.136
no rank, no assessment.

11
00:00:43.736 --> 00:00:47.534
Everything else is sorted
by who handles it, and by when.

12
00:00:48.134 --> 00:00:53.590
Open the insurer fax: every field
carries the exact words it came from.

13
00:00:54.290 --> 00:00:57.455
When Inbrev isn't sure, it doesn't guess.

14
00:00:57.657 --> 00:01:01.250
It says: you decide.
French and Italian work the same way.

15
00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:03.492
Now pull the cable.

16
00:01:03.866 --> 00:01:08.923
Apertus and Inbrev run on a network
with no way out – we checked:

17
00:01:08.923 --> 00:01:12.190
every attempt to reach the internet fails.

18
00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:14.410
Inbrev keeps sorting.

19
00:01:15.110 --> 00:01:16.628
No server in the practice?

20
00:01:17.228 --> 00:01:21.694
The same container can run at a Swiss
provider, in a Swiss data centre,

21
00:01:21.694 --> 00:01:26.097
engaged by the practice as an auxiliary
bound to professional secrecy.

22
00:01:26.797 --> 00:01:31.720
On a first synthetic
test set of 180 messages,

23
00:01:31.720 --> 00:01:37.713
Inbrev routes 88 % correctly with 8B,
and 91 % with 70B.

24
00:01:38.313 --> 00:01:40.481
Keyword rules reach 79 %.

25
00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:48.597
Of 16 messages with clinical content,
13 leave automation with 8B, 15 with 70B.

26
00:01:49.297 --> 00:01:54.104
Inbrev. Your practice inbox,
sorted where it belongs:

27
00:01:54.104 --> 00:01:57.105
in the practice, or in the Swiss cloud.
